  abilityDescription: "Enemy Caster. Immune to acid rain and pools. Pauses on the first tile outside the spawn point for 10 seconds. Summons 2 Oculite Spawns every 5 seconds, and 2 upon death."
  intelQuote: "*chittering from the darkness*"
  intelLore: "A worm-like caster entity swarming with eyes. It halts just after emerging to summon waves of oculite spawns while hurling crimson arts bolts at any operator within range."
